    "en": "Morning on the canal. I write one line in my notebook: “We can’t put it together. It is together.”\nAnd I draw a small ‘tree’ on the corner of the page.",
    "ja": "朝の運河。私は手帳に一行を書く。「We can't put it toghether. it is toghether.」\nそして、ページの端に小さな“木”を描いた。"
  },
